  "description": "Chi-Young might be completely useless as a guide, but he’s imprinted on the strongest ESPER around. It was love at first sight when Chi-Young was rescued from servitude by Baek-Han Gi, a beautiful and supremely powerful Lieutenant Colonel. But Baek-Han’s affection turned quickly to disgust when he realized the pretty, young guide he’d claimed was a man. The only way to end their bond is for one of them to die, but Chi-Young hates himself for how much he loves Baekhan…\n\n(Source: Tapas)\n\n*Note: Includes four extra chapters.*",
